<given-names>FL</given-names></string-name>. <article-title>Aneurysm diameter and proximal aortic neck diameter influence clinical outcome of endovascular abdominal aortic repair: a 4-year EUROSTAR experience</article-title>. <source><italic toggle="yes">Ann Vasc Surg</italic></source>. <year>2005</year>;<volume>19</volume>(<issue>6</issue>):<fpage>755</fpage>&#x02013;<lpage>761</lpage>. doi:<pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1007/s10016-005-7971-5</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16205849</pub-id>
</mixed-citation></ref><ref id="cit0008"><label>8.</label><mixed-citation publication-type="journal"><string-name><surname>Kaladji</surname>
